## Draft handoff scope

Child of1575. Provisional receiving disposition; a fresh lead must finish
the four premise checks and full exit criteria before implementation.

Use references/stata-caveats.md plus a bounded reproduce pointer, conditional on an authorized translation request, never a new translation/scoring mandate. Separate manual-documented facts, documentary inferences, case-calibrated observations, and open/historical uncertainty. Use official Stata manuals with edition/page links. No paper cases or case-fit formulas as generic defaults. Current Release19 manuals qualify generate defaults/set type, egen function-specific behavior, replace automatic promotions, explicit subscripts/division-by-zero, gmm constants/defaults, and Gaussian robust rgf. Historical actual release/settings remain unknown. xtgee pooled-AR/combined cluster factor is not established by matches. Depends on1577 for calibration/validation guidance.

## Validation boundary

Documentation/source verification and semantic/preservation checks, not numerical reruns or wording tests. No paid API model calls. Keep all existing scoring, signing and held author decisions unchanged.
